BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//WebMS Intra//Test fixture//EN
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:What this proves: the Windows zone names Microsoft 365 writes are
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:recognised, with no warning. "GMT Standard Time" is Europe/London and
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:"Eastern Standard Time" is America/New_York. On 7 October 2026 New York is
X-WEBMS-FIXTURE-NOTE:on daylight time, so 09:00 there is 14:00 in London.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:win-london-1@fixtures.webms.test
DTSTAMP:20260901T090000Z
DTSTART;TZID="GMT Standard Time":20261006T190000
DTEND;TZID="GMT Standard Time":20261006T200000
SUMMARY:Outlook London
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:win-newyork-1@fixtures.webms.test
DTSTAMP:20260901T090000Z
DTSTART;TZID="Eastern Standard Time":20261007T090000
DTEND;TZID="Eastern Standard Time":20261007T100000
SUMMARY:Outlook New York
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
